## Verdict

hbos 1-day p05 held d5 is the walk-forward straddle with the highest deduped ask/bid mean. Its edge versus matched random straddles is 0.042 in the walk-forward and 0.057 in the holdout. It is not tradable after the ask/bid cost. The holdout book does not clear both a positive mean and the matched random book, or the typical trade still gives back a large share of the premium.

